# OksaSDR tour, phone portrait 440x956 (frames 619x1344). Receive only.
ready
record 15
caption !speed 4
caption # On a phone
caption The same app on an iPhone or an Android phone.
wait 8000
caption !speed 1
caption The display fills the screen; the frequency, mode and slice are at the top.
wait 5500
caption FT8 on the go: the FTx tab decodes 20 m while you watch.
drawer 9
caption !mark 70,1290
wait 2500
tapname digiDecode
wait 1500
caption The decodes are under the FTx controls.
scroll 2000
wait 2500
caption !speed 3
caption Decoding: every 15 seconds the decodes of the last cycle come in. Tap one to answer it.
wait 40000
caption !speed 1
caption The decodes: time, SNR, offset and the message. CQs, your own calls and new ones stand out.
scroll 2000
wait 6000
shot p-ftx
scroll 0
wait 1500
tapname digiDecode
wait 1500
close
wait 1500
caption The ⋯ menu: Radio Setup, the Manual, the Log, Big buttons and Disconnect.
tap 0.93,0.03
wait 4500
shot p-menu
close
wait 1500
caption Turn the phone for the landscape layout.
size 956x440
wait 6000
shot p-land
size 440x956
wait 3000
caption -
record off
slices
shot end
